  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Boil the kettle. Half-fill a large saucepan with boiling water, then add a generous pinch of salt.\n• Peel potato and cut into large chunks.\n• Cook potato in the boiling water, over high heat, until easily pierced with a fork, 12-15 minutes. Drain and return to the pan.\n• Add the butter and milk to potato and season with salt. Mash until smooth. TIP: Save time and get more fibre by leaving the potato unpeeled.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6796cb99183b5afa14503ea7-44f993de.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, preheat grill to high.\n• Thinly slice brown onion.\n• Finely chop garlic.\n• Thinly slice zucchini into half-moons.\n• Drain and rinse cannellini beans.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6796cb99183b5afa14503ea7-0a5ab3e7.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook sliced mushrooms, stirring, until slightly browned and softened, 2-3 minutes.\n• Add zucchini and onion and cook, until tender, 4-5 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6796cb99183b5afa14503ea7-e40a8680.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Add cannellini beans, garlic, herb & mushroom seasoning and a drizzle of olive oil to pan, then cook, stirring until fragrant and slightly tender, 2 minutes.\n• Stir in light cooking cream, the water and vegetable stock powder and simmer, until slightly reduced, 1-2 minutes.\n• Remove from heat, add baby spinach leaves, stirring, until wilted. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6796cb99183b5afa14503ea7-2abaefc4.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Transfer mushroom filling into a baking dish and evenly spread mashed potato over the top. Sprinkle with Parmesan cheese.\n• Grill until lightly golden, 8-10 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6796cb99183b5afa14503ea7-c99a323b.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Divide creamy mushroom and white bean pie with cheesy mashed potato topping between plates to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6796cb99183b5afa14503ea7-e1cccc4e.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
